# 此目录用于存储从 ClawHub 安装的本地 Skill 包
# 每个 Skill 一个子目录，包含 SKILL.md + scripts/ + references/ + assets/
# 例如:
#   skills/
#   ├── ifind-repilot-finance-data-search/
#   │   ├── SKILL.md
#   │   ├── scripts/
#   │   │   └── fetch_data.py
#   │   └── references/
#   └── weather-query/
#       ├── SKILL.md
#       └── scripts/
#           └── weather.py
